            "name": "12 Labours of Hercules IV: Mother Nature (Platinum Edition)",
            "steam_appid": 396800,
            "required_age": 0,
            "is_free": false,
            "detailed_description": "<h1>Our latest games!</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join our Steam group to learn more about our games, events and giveaways</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></p><br><h1>Acerca do jogo</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/396800/extras/a7041a2bcfb23103365c25798811e222.avif?t=1789036668\" width=640 height=360 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hercules and Megara are back - and the Gods aren't happy about their last defeat. Furious, they've summoned a beast with strength to match Hercules's own, and it's already trampled the countryside, turning lush gardens into desert wastelands. In this fast-paced time management adventure, the couple sets out to restore what's been destroyed before Mother Nature is lost for good.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/396800/extras/6b4440393fdffe08de5b51f5c797d09f.avif?t=1789036668\" width=614 height=181 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Restoring the world takes everything Hercules and Megara have - from her magical abilities to, unexpectedly, a fire hydrant. Along the way they team up with legendary allies: King Midas lends his golden touch, and Epeius brings his engineering genius to help build the mighty Trojan Horse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/396800/extras/8a392b22519aba5c797df662edd74a50.avif?t=1789036668\" width=614 height=181 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can Hercules and Megara undo the Gods' wrath and save Mother Nature before it's too late? Play 12 Labours of Hercules IV: Mother Nature and find out - over 50 levels, a brand-new story, new music, and a bonus episode with a story all its own.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/396800/extras/983663099b2b6c4cbe481874df72cee2.avif?t=1789036668\" width=614 height=181 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast-paced time management gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 50 levels with a new story and new music</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Secret Challenges - certain levels hide extra objects to find</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build the mighty Trojan Horse alongside Epeius</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team up with King Midas and other legendary allies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atmospheric wallpapers and an integrated Strategy Guide</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bonus episode with a different story</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >22 unlockable Steam Achievements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steam Points Shop items available</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/396800/extras/9d09a18d802d1019186e08617bcca14a.avif?t=1789036668\" width=614 height=181 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Perfect For Fans Of</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Time management games</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Casual strategy</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Greek mythology</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relaxing single-player adventures</p></li></ul>",
            "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/396800/extras/a7041a2bcfb23103365c25798811e222.avif?t=1789036668\" width=640 height=360 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hercules and Megara are back - and the Gods aren't happy about their last defeat. Furious, they've summoned a beast with strength to match Hercules's own, and it's already trampled the countryside, turning lush gardens into desert wastelands. In this fast-paced time management adventure, the couple sets out to restore what's been destroyed before Mother Nature is lost for good.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/396800/extras/6b4440393fdffe08de5b51f5c797d09f.avif?t=1789036668\" width=614 height=181 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Restoring the world takes everything Hercules and Megara have - from her magical abilities to, unexpectedly, a fire hydrant. Along the way they team up with legendary allies: King Midas lends his golden touch, and Epeius brings his engineering genius to help build the mighty Trojan Horse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/396800/extras/8a392b22519aba5c797df662edd74a50.avif?t=1789036668\" width=614 height=181 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can Hercules and Megara undo the Gods' wrath and save Mother Nature before it's too late? Play 12 Labours of Hercules IV: Mother Nature and find out - over 50 levels, a brand-new story, new music, and a bonus episode with a story all its own.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/396800/extras/983663099b2b6c4cbe481874df72cee2.avif?t=1789036668\" width=614 height=181 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast-paced time management gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 50 levels with a new story and new music</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Secret Challenges - certain levels hide extra objects to find</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build the mighty Trojan Horse alongside Epeius</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team up with King Midas and other legendary allies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atmospheric wallpapers and an integrated Strategy Guide</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bonus episode with a different story</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >22 unlockable Steam Achievements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steam Points Shop items available</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/396800/extras/9d09a18d802d1019186e08617bcca14a.avif?t=1789036668\" width=614 height=181 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Perfect For Fans Of</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Time management games</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Casual strategy</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Greek mythology</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relaxing single-player adventures</p></li></ul>",
            "short_description": "The legendary hero Hercules and his wife Megara are back, ready to embark on their next adventure! The Gods are outraged at their defeat and have summoned a fearsome beast who can match Hercules's god-like strength.",
